sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User as Mac user
  participant Mac as macOS terminal
  participant VPN as Tailscale private network
  participant Phone as Android / Termux SSH
  participant Win as Windows desktop
  User->>Mac: Run wake-windows.sh
  Mac->>VPN: SSH using locally held private key
  VPN->>Phone: Authenticated SSH on private tailnet
  Phone->>Phone: Read local WoL target configuration
  Phone-->>Win: WoL magic packet (home LAN broadcast)
  Note over Win: Wired NIC and BIOS/UEFI must permit WoL
  Win-->>VPN: Tailscale comes online after Windows boot
  User->>VPN: Connect to Windows using RDP client
  VPN->>Win: Private RDP session
